The open-core distribution (this repository) contains the ncoda language
kernel: the frontend, the neutral IR, the runtime and the language-level
conformance gates. Platform adapters (compile/decompile pipelines, platform
identity tables and fixtures) and the foundry are distributed separately
under a commercial license and are not part of this repository.
